            "value": "Use Make Task to move a thought into Tasks; the original stays under Processed until you clear it."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mit „Aufgabe erstellen“ übernimmst du einen Gedanken in Aufgaben. Das Original bleibt unter „Verarbeitet“, bis du es entfernst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tendoTipCalendar": {
      "comment": "Tip interface text. Review meaning, tone, and on-screen context.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calendar and Reminders provide optional context without turning events into tasks."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kalender und Erinnerungen bieten auf Wunsch Kontext, ohne Termine in Aufgaben umzuwandeln."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tendoTipFocus": {
      "comment": "Tip interface text. Review meaning, tone, and on-screen context.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can start with five minutes; your Focus preferences remain adjustable."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du kannst mit fünf Minuten beginnen. Deine Fokus-Einstellungen lassen sich jederzeit anpassen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tendoTipNotifications": {
      "comment": "Tip interface text. Review meaning, tone, and on-screen context.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only enable reminders that help. Quiet hours can keep them gentle."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aktiviere nur hilfreiche Erinnerungen. Ruhezeiten können sie sanft halten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tendoTipNow": {
      "comment": "Tip interface text. Review meaning, tone, and on-screen context.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep the next action small. You can use Start 5 without planning your whole day."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Halte die nächste Handlung klein. Mit „5 starten“ kannst du beginnen, ohne den ganzen Tag zu planen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tendoTipPersonalization": {
      "comment": "Tip interface text. Review meaning, tone, and on-screen context.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your theme and preferred greeting are optional and saved on this device."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Design und deine bevorzugte Begrüßung sind optional und werden auf diesem Gerät gespeichert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tendoTipProgress": {
      "comment": "Tip interface text. Review meaning, tone, and on-screen context.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Small wins and short Focus sessions are still worth noticing."
